# Test: TodoService
## Target: MyApp.Application.TodoService.cs
## Coverage: 100% scenario-coverage, 100% requirement-coverage, must-level

### Test Scenarios
- Given an empty repository When Create is called with a valid request Then the item is stored and returned
- Should throw ArgumentNullException when the request is null

### Edge Cases
- Given a completed todo item When Create is called with the same title Then both items coexist

### Performance Tests
- Should create a todo item under 50 ms

### RequirementCoverage
- Covers M-001
- Covers REQ-2
